If an external link is provided, the IM must ensure that the document is available at the provided link."""@en .


###  http://data.europa.eu/949/eddyCurrentBraking
:eddyCurrentBraking rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty ;
                    rdfs:subPropertyOf :trackObjParameter ,
                                       :trackResistanceToAppliedLoadsObjParameter ;
                    rdf:type owl:FunctionalProperty ;
                    rdfs:domain [ rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                  owl:unionOf ( :CommonCharacteristicsSubset
                                                :RunningTrack
                                              )
                                ] ;
                    rdfs:range <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> ;
                    :applicable "Y/N/NYA" ;
                    :inSkosConceptScheme <http://data.europa.eu/949/concepts/eddy-current-braking/EddyCurrentBraking> ;
                    :legalDeadline "12 months after publication of Article 7 Guide for OP tracks"@en ,
                                   "In accordance with Implementing Decision 2014/880/EU and by 16 March 2019 at the latest"@en ;
                    :rinfIndex "1.1.1.1.6.2" ,
                               "1.2.1.0.4.2" ;
                    :shaclShapeValidationRule <http://data.europa.eu/949/shapes/EddyCurrentBraking> ,
                                              <http://data.europa.eu/949/shapes/EddyCurrentBrakingSKOS> ;
                    :tsiOPEAppendixD2Index "3.4.5" ;
                    :usedInRCCCalculations "true"^^xsd:boolean ;
                    <http://purl.org/dc/terms/created> "2020-08-24"^^xsd:date ;
                    <http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> "2022-09-06"^^xsd:date ,
                                                        "2024-09-19"^^xsd:date ,
                                                        "2025-02-28"^^xsd:date ,
                                                        "2025-03-04"^^xsd:date ;
                    <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/reg/2014/1299/2023-09-28> ,
                                                      <http://data.europa.eu/eli/reg_impl/2019/773/oj> ;
                    rdfs:comment "Indication of limitations on the use of eddy current brakes."@en ;
                    rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://data.europa.eu/949/> ;
                    rdfs:label "Use of eddy current brakes"@en ;
                    rdfs:seeAlso """INF TSI: 4.2.6.2.2 (2)
OPE TSI: 4.2.2.6.2 (1) (iv)""" ;
                    <http://www.w3.org/2003/06/sw-vocab-status/ns#term_status> "stable" ;
                    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#editorialNote> "This property has been modified to be a RINF parameter (its eratvIndex is deleted). It is treated as a SKOS by RINF and as a boolean by ERATV. A new ERATV datatype property has been defined, eddyCurrentBrakingFitted with boolean values."@en ;
                    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> """The use of both brakes is allowed or not under exterior conditions (depending on the features of the train engines for example).
The RINF can't be filled without more precisions."""@en .


###  http://data.europa.eu/949/eddyCurrentBrakingConditionsDocument
:eddyCurrentBrakingConditionsDocument rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty ;
                                      rdfs:subPropertyOf :trackResistanceToAppliedLoadsObjParameter ;
                                      rdfs:domain [ rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                                    owl:unionOf ( :CommonCharacteristicsSubset
                                                                  :RunningTrack
                                                                )
                                                  ] ;
                                      rdfs:range :Document ;
                                      :XMLName "ILR_ECBDocRef" ;
                                      :applicable "Y/N" ;
                                      :dependencyNote "Mandatory value to be provided when 1.1.1.1.6.2/Use of eddy current brakes is  allowed under conditions  or  allowed under conditions only for emergency brake"@en ;
                                      :legalDeadline "16 January 2020"@en ;
                                      :rinfIndex "1.1.1.1.6.4" ;
                                      :shaclShapeValidationRule <http://data.europa.eu/949/shapes/EddyCurrentBrakingConditionsDocument> ,
                                                                <http://data.europa.eu/949/shapes/EddyCurrentBrakingConditionsDocumentApplicability> ;
                                      :tsiOPEAppendixD2Index "3.4.5" ;
                                      :usedInRCCCalculations "true"^^xsd:boolean ;
                                      <http://purl.org/dc/terms/created> "2020-08-24"^^xsd:date ;
                                      <http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> "2021-09-10"^^xsd:date ,
                                                                          "2024-04-23"^^xsd:date ,
                                                                          "2024-09-19"^^xsd:date ;
                                      <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/reg_impl/2019/773/oj> ;
                                      rdfs:comment "Electronic document available in two EU languages from the IM stored by the Agency with conditions for the use of eddy current brakes identified in 1.1.1.1.6.2."@en ;
                                      rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://data.europa.eu/949/> ;
                                      rdfs:label "Document with the conditions for the use of eddy current brakes"@en ;
                                      <http://www.w3.org/2003/06/sw-vocab-status/ns#term_status> "stable" ;
                                      <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#changeNote> "Change from datatype property to object property in order to point to the class Document (reference document)"@en ;
                                      <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> """If there exist conditions to allow the use of eddy current brakes.

The value of this parameter should be either a reference to a file name or an external link to a document.
If a file name is provided, the Infrastructure Manager (IM) must upload a document with the same file name using the \"Reference Documents Management\" functionality in the RINF application. The document must be in electronic format and available in two official EU languages. In this case, the parameter value must be repeated for each document.
If an external link is provided, the IM must ensure that the document is available at the provided link."""@en .


